Title: "Offset"
Id: "4a28e62b-3a9f-456c-9503-0d913329272c"

Text: "`offset:` records the physical PDF page on which the document's numbered page 1
appears. It defaults to `1`, so a `References:` entry written `:page{n}` links to
physical page `n + offset - 1`.

```mlg-fragment
Resource:
. offset: \"12\"
```

The value is `OpenText`: it must be quoted in source, the outer quotes are stripped, and no escape processing is performed. Resource cards in `mlg view` use `title:` as the visible title and make it a hyperlink when `url:` is present."
Id: "0ab1005e-6de3-4ec2-aa6e-fe18ede06ef6"
